  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Efficient Securities Markets Institutional        Development (ESMID) - Efficient Securities Markets Institutional Develop</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Efficient Securities Markets Institutional        Development (ESMID)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genomf&#xf6;rande av pilotprojekt f&#xf6;r &quot;holistisk&quot; utveckling av            l&#xe5;ngsiktiga kapitalmarknaderna i (&#xd6;st) Afrika (EAC). Helhetssyn f&#xf6;r   att &#xf6;vervinna hinder f&#xf6;r lokal kapitalbildning riktad mot fattigdom   orienterad finansiering som infrastruktur och bost&#xe4;der. Fokus ligger  p&#xe5; marknaderna f&#xf6;r icke-statliga obligationer. Positiva effekter      kommer ocks&#xe5; att f&#xf6;lja f&#xf6;r v&#xe4;rdepappersmarknaderna i en vidare bem&#xe4;rk</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of pilot for &quot;holistic&quot; development of long term       capital markets in (East) Africa (EAC). Holistic approach to overcome hurdles for local capital accumulation directed at poverty oriented   financing such as infrastructure and housing. Focus is placed on      markets for non-government bonds. Positive effects will also follow   for securities markets in a broader sense.</narrative>
  </description>
